                <span id="roomPinText" class="font-fredoka text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-widest">---</span>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300 mt-1">Status: Bagikan PIN/Link di atas ke HP tiap kelompok siswa</p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center mb-8">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-500/20 border border-emerald-400/30 text-emerald-300 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
                    🏛️ MTs N 5 TEGAL - KELAS 8/9 IPS
                </span>
                <h2 class="font-fredoka text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mt-2 mb-2">Kompetisi Kelompok IPS 🇲🇨</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base">Mengkaji Potensi Indonesia Menjadi Negara Maju melalui Kuis Interaktif</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                <!-- SISI KIRI: ATUR TIM -->
                <div class="space-y-5">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-amber-300 flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-white/10 pb-2">
